Goal: Optimize the utilization of loan officers while preventing overload, ensuring that the loan assessment process remains efficient and effective.

  1. Loan Officer Workload Distribution [utilization] — minimize (scope: end_to_end)

Reasoning: This KPI set is designed to address the simulation goal of optimizing loan officer utilization while preventing overload. The KPIs include measures of overall cycle time, workload distribution, activity duration, and waiting times, all of which are grounded in the provided event log evidence. Each KPI is measurable and relevant to the goal, ensuring that the loan assessment process remains efficient and effective.

